# The cases of Unicode's text rendering tests (https://github.com/unicode-org/text-rendering-tests) cascade fails,
# for tools/textRenderingTests.py --known: each a case's id or the start of ids, and why.

# Apple's AAT substitutions (morx, mort): cascade does not read them
MORX-
MORT-

# emoji in a CFF font: where the system has a color emoji font (Windows), cascade draws them from it
